  ================  P = 2 pipes  (spec claims preimage = 2^(P*n0) = 2^{2*n0})
    8 | JOUX   | K=12  (=(P-1)n0+4) | log2(calls)~  12.0 | OK 2nd-preimage, K=12
   10 | JOUX   | K=14  (=(P-1)n0+4) | log2(calls)~  13.0 | OK 2nd-preimage, K=14
   12 | JOUX   | K=16  (=(P-1)n0+4) | log2(calls)~  17.0 | OK 2nd-preimage, K=16
   14 | JOUX   | K=18  (=(P-1)n0+4) | log2(calls)~  23.0 | OK 2nd-preimage, K=18
   16 | JOUX   | K=20  (=(P-1)n0+4) | log2(calls)~  24.0 | OK 2nd-preimage, K=20
    -> JOUX  d K / d n0 = 1.00   (predict P-1 = 1)  <-- clean structural exponent
    -> NAIVE fitted slope d log2(trial-work)/d n0 = 3.00   (predict P = 2; noisy, few pts)
  ================  P = 3 pipes  (spec claims preimage = 2^(P*n0) = 2^{3*n0})
